# Cloudflare Pages redirect rules (rebrand + migration round, 2026-08-07).
# Cloudflare Pages serves the WHOLE repo by path, so the build docs, history and
# tooling (which carry the owner's name and the full change log) would otherwise be
# publicly reachable at pagefront.co.uk. Force a 404 for every non-site path that
# exists in this repo. The shipped site files (index.html, css/, js/, media/,
# fonts/, favicon.svg, favicon-32.png, apple-touch-icon.png, og-image.png) are not
# listed here, so they continue to be served normally.
# UK English, no em dashes.

/PROGRESS.md      /  404
/CONCEPT.md       /  404
/verify/*         /  404
/docs/*           /  404
/tools/*          /  404
/references/*     /  404
/.claude/*        /  404
